WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:13.889
Bello: What do we do?

2
00:00:13.909 --> 00:00:16.531
Danny: Maybe it will just go away.

3
00:00:16.552 --> 00:00:20.695
Brad: It can smell us.

4
00:00:21.275 --> 00:00:22.276
It knows we're here.

5
00:00:22.296 --> 00:00:27.060
Chuck: Danny, why don't you put some nano-putty on it and shrink it?

6
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.641
Brad: The nano-putty doesn't work that way.

7
00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:38.922
Dave: It's worth a try, isn't it?

8
00:00:38.942 --> 00:00:43.604
Brad: I guess it couldn't hurt to try.

9
00:00:43.624 --> 00:00:48.106
Danny? Danny: Fine.

10
00:00:48.266 --> 00:00:48.926
I'll do it.

11
00:00:49.686 --> 00:00:51.567
But I think this is very risky.

12
00:00:56.969 --> 00:00:59.250
Good mouse, nice mouse.

13
00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:01.711
Danny: You don't want to eat me.

14
00:01:02.591 --> 00:01:03.772
I'm not very tasty.

15
00:01:04.284 --> 00:01:06.645
Danny: I just want to put this stuff on your paw.

16
00:01:06.665 --> 00:01:08.106
Danny: Then I'll go.

17
00:01:09.066 --> 00:01:10.627
You won't even notice I was here.

18
00:01:15.709 --> 00:01:16.669
Watch out, Danny!

19
00:01:16.689 --> 00:01:18.150
Danny: Hide!

20
00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:19.490
Everybody hide!

21
00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:23.892
Bello: Everybody stand back!

22
00:01:24.933 --> 00:01:28.414
Dave: Wow, those claws are dangerous.

23
00:01:28.434 --> 00:01:30.875
Danny: I told you it was risky!

24
00:01:30.895 --> 00:01:32.696
Brad: Now what?

25
00:01:36.612 --> 00:01:39.573
Tina: Maybe we can sneak out on the other side of the drawer.

26
00:01:39.593 --> 00:01:41.154
Chuck: Tina's right.

27
00:01:41.174 --> 00:01:42.515
Tina: Follow me.

28
00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:48.918
Dave: Do you think it's safe?

29
00:01:49.338 --> 00:01:51.539
Brad: Someone should check first.

30
00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.822
Danny: Why do I have to go?

31
00:01:57.482 --> 00:01:59.023
That mouse almost ate me!

32
00:01:59.043 --> 00:02:01.124
Bello: I'll look.

33
00:02:06.252 --> 00:02:07.032
Chuck: Do you see it?

34
00:02:07.052 --> 00:02:09.653
Bello: No, I don't see anything.

35
00:02:09.673 --> 00:02:12.074
Dave: Maybe the nano-putty worked.

36
00:02:12.094 --> 00:02:14.655
Brad: I guess it is possible.

37
00:02:19.817 --> 00:02:20.838
I don't see anything.

38
00:02:20.858 --> 00:02:22.719
Chuck: I think we're safe.

39
00:02:22.739 --> 00:02:24.519
Dave: I was right.

40
00:02:24.539 --> 00:02:28.661
Dave: I bet you the nano-putty turned it into the teeny-tiniest mouse.

41
00:02:29.621 --> 00:02:31.702
Dave: If I see it again, I'll squash it.

42
00:02:33.883 --> 00:02:35.504
Danny: There it is!

43
00:02:36.544 --> 00:02:38.345
Brad: That is one sneaky mouse.

44
00:02:38.705 --> 00:02:39.385
Bello: Watch out!

45
00:02:39.405 --> 00:02:43.346
Tina: We're trapped.

46
00:02:47.067 --> 00:02:48.928
We can't stay under here forever.

47
00:02:48.948 --> 00:02:50.748
Brad: What else can we do?

48
00:02:50.768 --> 00:02:53.069
Danny: We escaped from the mites.

49
00:02:53.709 --> 00:02:54.629
We tricked the ants.

50
00:02:54.649 --> 00:02:57.350
Danny: We made it all the way to the garage.

51
00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:01.431
Danny: I can't believe a stupid little mouse is going to stop us.

52
00:03:05.068 --> 00:03:09.229
Tina: That mouse isn't very little, and I don't think it's very stupid.

53
00:03:09.249 --> 00:03:12.630
Brad: I wish I'd never made that shrink-gun!

54
00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:14.791
Bello: It's too early to give up hope.

55
00:03:14.811 --> 00:03:19.432
Bello: My dad says there is always a solution, even if you can't see it.

56
00:03:26.994 --> 00:03:28.154
Brad, it's your cat!

57
00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:31.535
Brad: I told you Tabby was a good kitty!

58
00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:33.796
Everyone: Hooray for Tabby!
